        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "NOTE 3 Table B.17 and Table B.18 specify that both CRLDistributionPoints and AuthorityInfoAccess extensions are optional but critical to indicate that either of them may be included or neither of them may be included. But if they are included, the relying party of these certificates processes them. [V2G20-2606] clarifies that if the issuer desires to include both of these, it is up to the relying party to decide which one to process. However, the relying party processes at least one.",
            "block_bbox": [
